<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50216" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰθύς</span></b>  (B) [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑθῡ], ἡ</span>, used by <i><span class="en">
			Hom.
		</span></i> only in acc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰθύν</span>: <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀν᾽ ἰθύν</span>,= <i>against</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς ῥόον ἀΐσσοντος ἀν᾽ ἰθύν</span>
			<i>against</i> the stream, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				21.303
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπεὶ δὴ σφαίρῃ ἀν᾽ ἰθὺν
				πειρήσαντο</span> in throwing <i>straight upwards</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				8.377
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς ἰθύν</span>
			v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				14.403
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>enterprise</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἷσι μάλιστα πεποίθεα πᾶσαν ἐπ᾽ ἰθύν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					4.434
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄριστοι πᾶσαν ἐπ᾽ ἰθύν ἐστε
					μάχεσθαί τε φρονέειν τε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					6.79
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυναικῶν γνώομεν ἰθύν</span>
			their <i>mood, designs</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				16.304
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμὴν ἰ</span>. dub. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Ap.</u>
				539
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
